{"status":"UP","timestamp":"2024-01-15T09:42:33.847Z","components":{"database":"UP","cache":"UP","messaging":"UP"},"version":"8.10.2"}
</code></pre> <p>Common errors</p> Error Fix <code>curl: (60) SSL certificate problem: self signed certificate</code> Add the <code>-k</code> flag to skip certificate verification, or import the CA certificate into your system trust store. <code>curl: (7) Failed to connect to vidm.example.local port 443: Connection refused</code> Verify the vIDM hostname/IP is correct, the service is running (<code>systemctl status vidm</code>), and network connectivity exists from lcm-prod-01 to the vIDM appliance. <p>After registration, the LCM login page shows a "Log In with Workspace ONE" button that redirects to VIDM for authentication.</p>

